// Pawn's API (`PawnGetItemData`, `PawnIsItemAnUpgrade`), as `pawn.lua` reads it: another addon's, which the client's
// declarations don't hold. Every call into it is a protected one: its API may change.

// Whether Pawn is loaded and has the two functions.
public function present(): Boolean
// How much better than what the player wears the item is by the best of Pawn's scales (0.15: 15%); nil where it is no
// upgrade, or Pawn can't say.
public function upgrade(link: String): Number | nil
